          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "болеть (bolét) from Proto-Slavic bolěti, with боль, \"pain\" — inherited (Vasmer). Vasmer sets it beside Old English bealu, \"evil\", a link Berneker rejected."
